Phase 1:
Event Intake System

Hum pehla workflow manually banayenge:

Webhook
   ↓
Validate
   ↓
Normalize
   ↓
Response

Example:

Business system send karega:

{
  "customer_id": "CUS-001",
  "order_id": "ORD-1001",
  "message": "My order is 3 days late",
  "source": "customer_support"
}

n8n receive karega → data validate karega →